    "sentence_translations": [
      "Recharging Yourself",
      "",
      "When our phone is out of battery, we recharge it;",
      "When our camera is out of battery, we recharge it.",
      "Apart from electrical appliances, we can also recharge ourselves.",
      "Of course, recharging yourself is not the same as recharging an electrical appliance.",
      "“Recharging” yourself is to make yourself continuously acquire new knowledge, ..",
      ".. to continuously improve yourself, and to enrich yourself.",
      "",
      "Nowadays, society develops faster and faster, and the competition is more and more fierce.",
      "We have to continuously “recharge” ourself in order to keep up with society's progress.",
      "There are many ways to “recharge”, such as reading, learning new things, working out…",
      "As long as it is beneficial for yourself, you can call it “recharging”,",
      "",
      "Have you “recharged” yourself today?",
